codex
The final family is now materially stronger than the earlier quadratic draft: the hidden relation yields the small factors through one remainder, so the intended no-tool route is 9 high-level operations and at most 96 digitwise steps—well under G9’s effort cap and without a large integer square root. All local gates still pass after that change. I’m doing the last schema, determinism, transcript, and documentation consistency audit now.
