-The local executable reference is a bounded-prime scan.  Across eight shipping instances it solved 8/8 after 851,984 trial divisions (106,498 per instance on average) in 0.040653 seconds.  This is easy with code and unrealistic by hand.  The compact route notices
+and `K <= r < 2K`, it follows that
 
 ```text
-N_B - N_A = r - p.
+r = (D mod (2K-1)) + K - 1,
